# Spike APT — tracked template (NOT staged into live-build config/archives/
# until packages.bigrangatech.com answers — otherwise lb apt update fails).
# Installed systems use includes.chroot …/spike.sources (Enabled: no by default).
#
# When hosting is live, set Enabled: yes in spike.sources. Optional live-build stage:
# deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/spike-archive-keyring.gpg] https://packages.bigrangatech.com/spike spike main
